OL,3,GNEWSAPanto return planned for
OL,4,ARaac-affected theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent theatre which closed over fears
OL,7,Fof dangerous concrete say it is
OL,8,Fconfident the venue will reopen in time
OL,9,Ffor this year's pantomime season.
OL,11,FThe Orchard Theatre in Dartford shut in
OL,12,FSeptember 2023 after reinforced
OL,13,Fautoclaved aerated concrete (Raac) was
OL,14,Ffound in its roof.
OL,16,FIt had been due to reopen in May 2025,
OL,17,Fbut the date was pushed back after
OL,18,FDartford Borough Council identified
OL,19,Ffurther essential work needed to meet
OL,20,Fsafety requirements.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
